nes of output, byte-identical (`cmp` clean), both exit 0.** A separate run enabling the duplicate-ID cycle case stack-overflowed in *both* libraries at the same point with identical output — same bug, faithfully reproduced.\n\n`cargo build --release` compiles clean with no warnings. Nothing in `c_src/` was modified (scratch build dir removed).","ttft_ms":3428,"ttft_stream_ms":3189,"time_to_request_ms":40,"type":"result","duration_ms":273421,"uuid":"31248c18-8778-4627-b6b0-3270bd846a7a","queued_turn_count":0}
